    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 2: Punctuation"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "**Capital letters** begin sentences and names. A **comma** separates the things in a list. **Speech marks** go round the exact words someone says. An **apostrophe** shows that letters are missing, or that something belongs to someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "explainer",
      "title": "What the apostrophe does",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "caption": "Two words: do and not.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "do",
              "x": 30,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "a",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "not",
              "x": 65,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "b",
              "size": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "Squash them together and the letter o falls out.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "do",
              "x": 40,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "a",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "n't",
              "x": 62,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "b",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "pulse"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "The apostrophe takes the place of the missing o: don't.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "don't",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "a",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "grow",
              "label": "apostrophe replaces o"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "It also shows who owns something. The dog's bone is the bone that belongs to the dog.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "🐕",
              "x": 30,
              "y": 50,
              "size": 3,
              "label": "dog's"
            },
            {
              "emoji": "🦴",
              "x": 70,
              "y": 55,
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "bounce",
              "label": "bone"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
