    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 3: Tenses"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "**Tense** tells us when something happens. Past: I walked. Present: I walk. Future: I will walk. Some verbs change in tricky ways, like go becomes went."
    },
    {
      "type": "explainer",
      "title": "Past, present and future",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "caption": "Yesterday I walked to school. That is the past.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "🚶",
              "x": 20,
              "y": 55,
              "id": "me",
              "size": 3,
              "label": "walked (past)"
            },
            {
