    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Stop 4: Building words and meanings"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "markdown": "A **prefix** goes at the start of a word and changes its meaning, like un in unhappy. A **suffix** goes at the end, like ful in careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "explainer",
      "title": "Building new words",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "caption": "Start with the word happy.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "happy",
              "x": 55,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w",
              "size": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "Add the prefix un at the start.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "un",
              "x": 25,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "p",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "grow"
            },
            {
              "emoji": "happy",
              "x": 62,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w",
              "size": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "Unhappy means not happy. A prefix changed the meaning!",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "unhappy",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "w",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "pulse",
              "label": "not happy"
            },
            {
              "emoji": "😢",
              "x": 50,
              "y": 15,
              "size": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "caption": "Now try a suffix. Add ful to care and you get careful, which means full of care.",
          "items": [
            {
              "emoji": "care",
              "x": 35,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "c",
              "size": 3
            },
            {
              "emoji": "ful",
              "x": 68,
              "y": 50,
              "id": "s",
              "size": 3,
              "anim": "grow",
              "label": "suffix"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
